# forgeSDLC — Alembic Migrations

PostgreSQL schema migrations for the forgeSDLC memory layer.

## Running migrations

```bash
# Apply all pending migrations
alembic upgrade head

# Roll back one migration
alembic downgrade -1

# Check current revision
alembic current
```

## Environment

`DATABASE_URL` must be set before running any Alembic command:

```bash
export DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://postgres:localdev@localhost:5432/forgesdlc
alembic upgrade head
```

Or use the Makefile helper which starts a local Docker PostgreSQL:

```bash
make db-start      # start PostgreSQL in Docker
alembic upgrade head
```

## Creating a new migration

```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "short description of change"
```

Review the generated file in `versions/` before applying.
